---
name: Bug report
description: Report a problem with an AI Tech Safar resource or tool
title: "[Bug] "
labels: [bug]
body:
  - type: textarea
    id: issue
    attributes:
      label: What went wrong?
      description: Describe the problem and steps to reproduce it.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: url
    attributes:
      label: Affected page URL
  - type: textarea
    id: expected
    attributes:
      label: What did you expect?
